A Midnight Rook that was already invoked was called by the [[Casterwill Hunters]] to fight [[Lok Lambert|Lok Lambert's]] [[Ironsquire]] and [[Dante Vale|Dante Vale's]] [[Caliban]], but was defeated when Caliban jumped on top of it. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}}

Midnight Rook was used by [[Marduk]] to track down the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] team on the way to the [[Pyramid of the Sun]] in [[Teotihuacan, Mexico]]. {{Source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

Midnight Rook again was used by a group of [[Silent Soldiers]] to spy on [[Den Fears]] and Dante outside the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. After being followed back to its master by Dante's [[Solwing]], it then fought alongside [[Harlekin]] but was shot down by Den's new Titan [[Cursed Archer]]. {{Source|Sophie on Trial}}

Marduk used Midnight Rook again to fight in the strike against the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. After assisting [[Cerberus]] in defeating [[Sentinel]], Midnight Rook followed Marduk up the cliffs to chase [[Santiago]]. {{Source|The Spiral War}}
